# No end-of-line normalisation anywhere in this repository.
#
# What is published here has to be byte-identical to what was built and to the
# patches that describe it. Git's usual normalisation is helpful in a working
# repository and wrong here: doc/API-datastruct.html carries five stray CR
# characters as CONTENT, and its patch is checked out verbatim for that reason.
# A blanket CRLF-to-LF pass makes every hunk apply and reconstructs a file
# upstream never was.
* -text
